{
"file": 309,
"paths": [
"d008/d000/f024"
],
"lines": [
{
"n": 0,
"h": "43877564",
"en_raw": "...Um, excuse me"
},
{
"n": 1,
"h": "b227777d",
"en_raw": "sorry to call so late"
},
{
"n": 2,
"h": "545c90ed",
"en_raw": "I'm Murase"
},
{
"n": 3,
"h": "c64a746c",
"en_raw": "from class 2-3"
},
{
"n": 4,
"h": "abc17f2f",
"en_raw": "Is Shinta Segawa there?"
},
{
"n": 5,
"h": "ef009bec",
"en_raw": "Oh, Murase?"
},
{
"n": 6,
"h": "73fc77a5",
"en_raw": "Please wait a moment"
},
{
"n": 7,
"h": "b7f9f02e",
"en_raw": ".........."
},
{
"n": 8,
"h": "9e45fadf",
"en_raw": "...I'm so sorry"
},
{
"n": 9,
"h": "49185a83",
"en_raw": "Somehow"
},
{
"n": 10,
"h": "e8c9b27f",
"en_raw": "I don't really understand"
},
{
"n": 11,
"h": "94bcc255",
"en_raw": "but he says he's unwell"
},
{
"n": 12,
"h": "80cdc399",
"en_raw": "and can't come to the phone"
},
{
"n": 13,
"h": "46da19e5",
"en_raw": "Was it urgent?"
},
{
"n": 14,
"h": "4cdd7774",
"en_raw": "Um, then..."
},
{
"n": 15,
"h": "e0dd33db",
"en_raw": "please tell him"
},
{
"n": 16,
"h": "b71aebab",
"en_raw": "that Kume apologized"
},
{
"n": 17,
"h": "73fc77a5",
"en_raw": "Please wait a moment"
},
{
"n": 18,
"h": "a818bbea",
"en_raw": "Maybe it's better to"
},
{
"n": 19,
"h": "52886e60",
"en_raw": "tell Shinta directly..."
},
{
"n": 20,
"h": "225832df",
"en_raw": "Oh, no, it's fine"
},
{
"n": 21,
"h": "ac90acab",
"en_raw": "He went to the trouble of calling"
},
{
"n": 22,
"h": "2e308fe8",
"en_raw": "how rude of him"
},
{
"n": 23,
"h": "bcf8baed",
"en_raw": "...Shinta! Please"
},
{
"n": 24,
"h": "754eef3d",
"en_raw": "stop saying silly things"
},
{
"n": 25,
"h": "51c66694",
"en_raw": "and come to the phone!"
},
{
"n": 26,
"h": "8e2d4ff5",
"en_raw": "..............."
},
{
"n": 27,
"h": "b5596c9d",
"en_raw": "Murase"
},
{
"n": 28,
"h": "e4082e46",
"en_raw": "I told you no phone calls, didn't I?"
},
{
"n": 29,
"h": "cd5d4e75",
"en_raw": "Segawa, it's all over"
},
{
"n": 30,
"h": "daf39e89",
"en_raw": "I talked with Kume"
},
{
"n": 31,
"h": "0c8f7dd7",
"en_raw": "and he said he'd"
},
{
"n": 32,
"h": "997294db",
"en_raw": "apologize to you by phone"
},
{
"n": 33,
"h": "313ba078",
"en_raw": "...What!?"
},
{
"n": 34,
"h": "9ba6675f",
"en_raw": "What do you mean?"
},
{
"n": 35,
"h": "53026911",
"en_raw": "...So"
},
{
"n": 36,
"h": "c854e0d6",
"en_raw": "the wiretap must be a lie too"
},
{
"n": 37,
"h": "0953b6bc",
"en_raw": "There's nothing to worry about anymore"
},
{
"n": 38,
"h": "8e2d4ff5",
"en_raw": "..............."
},
{
"n": 39,
"h": "cfc229fa",
"en_raw": "Murase, do you know"
},
{
"n": 40,
"h": "e956b797",
"en_raw": "what that guy said to me?"
},
{
"n": 41,
"h": "e9820d36",
"en_raw": "...I can pretty much guess"
},
{
"n": 42,
"h": "d1e682aa",
"en_raw": "...Do you think I can forgive that?"
},
{
"n": 43,
"h": "6fc264c6",
"en_raw": "But Segawa, you also did to Yuasa..."
},
{
"n": 44,
"h": "8cd743f9",
"en_raw": "I couldn't help it!"
},
{
"n": 45,
"h": "fde38725",
"en_raw": "I was threatened"
},
{
"n": 46,
"h": "564d472b",
"en_raw": "with being killed!"
},
{
"n": 47,
"h": "a30163da",
"en_raw": "Yeah"
},
{
"n": 48,
"h": "9a6883a9",
"en_raw": "But Kume was in danger too"
},
{
"n": 49,
"h": "0d332980",
"en_raw": "Thanks to Yuasa running away"
},
{
"n": 50,
"h": "fcbd5d3e",
"en_raw": "nothing wrong"
},
{
"n": 51,
"h": "22532065",
"en_raw": "happened, but..."
},
{
"n": 52,
"h": "3f432bff",
"en_raw": "...M-Murase, you know"
},
{
"n": 53,
"h": "6f43aca1",
"en_raw": "you're awful too"
},
{
"n": 54,
"h": "c4df8268",
"en_raw": "Why?"
},
{
"n": 55,
"h": "61c35ef8",
"en_raw": "It sounds as if"
},
{
"n": 56,
"h": "c4d7dff7",
"en_raw": "you're saying I lack courage"
},
{
"n": 57,
"h": "6bc6641c",
"en_raw": "and blaming me for it"
},
{
"n": 58,
"h": "2f1063e8",
"en_raw": "That's how it sounds"
},
{
"n": 59,
"h": "3a1c5145",
"en_raw": "Why would you say that"
},
{
"n": 60,
"h": "09d469c1",
"en_raw": "It's true, I'm scared of Kume"
},
{
"n": 61,
"h": "0048009a",
"en_raw": "and Yuasa"
},
{
"n": 62,
"h": "68f64145",
"en_raw": "walks all over me too"
},
{
"n": 63,
"h": "e7296f8a",
"en_raw": "But I'm sick"
},
{
"n": 64,
"h": "a4b8a3c6",
"en_raw": "of being the victim"
},
{
"n": 65,
"h": "c0c9ca53",
"en_raw": "I don't think I did"
},
{
"n": 66,
"h": "447af53b",
"en_raw": "anything wrong, not a bit"
},
{
"n": 67,
"h": "e96687f5",
"en_raw": "...Segawa"
},
{
"n": 68,
"h": "9942a8ff",
"en_raw": "I'm not crying"
},
{
"n": 69,
"h": "098d8733",
"en_raw": "But I don't want"
},
{
"n": 70,
"h": "d1b7d7da",
"en_raw": "to talk with you any more right now"
},
{
"n": 71,
"h": "b7f9f02e",
"en_raw": ".........."
},
{
"n": 72,
"h": "0c92dce3",
"en_raw": "I'm hanging up"
},
{
"n": 73,
"h": "34cf0292",
"en_raw": "........"
},
{
"n": 74,
"h": "ed99d5d3",
"en_raw": "I don't know the road ahead..."
},
{
"n": 75,
"h": "b5bb2ada",
"en_raw": "For a walk, this is"
},
{
"n": 76,
"h": "e7d20466",
"en_raw": "a bit too far"
},
{
"n": 77,
"h": "c0e859da",
"en_raw": "If we go somewhere unfamiliar"
},
{
"n": 78,
"h": "c1f8d9b5",
"en_raw": "we won't be able to get home"
}
]
}